#: includes/Admin/Privacy.php:22
msgid "Multisite Radar is an audit tool for network administrators. It collects no data from visitors and makes no external requests. To build its inventory of the network, it keeps in the network database a copy of data that WordPress already holds: for each site, the user IDs and logins of up to 50 administrators and editors, and the number of users per role. This copy is refreshed in the background and deleted when the plugin is uninstalled. When a user account is deleted, the sites it belonged to are analysed again."
msgstr ""

